entities.json
*.entities.json
# The triage file names every candidate a halt wants classified, quoting the
# redacted line each one stands on. That is a worklist about a real document,
# and it lands in the directory the operator sends from, so it is never
# committable either.
*.triage.md
# save writes the map through a neighbouring .tmp holding the same real values.
# It refuses to write one at a path git would let you commit, and a hard kill or
# a power loss can leave one behind, so a rule has to cover the .tmp as well.
*.tmp
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
__pycache__/
